    example: "Price [[$1,000M]]. Book equity [[$400M]], including [[$50M]] of old goodwill. Write-ups: PP&E [[$100M]], intangibles [[$200M]]; DTL at [[25%]]: $75M. Identifiable net assets: $400M − $50M + $300M − $75M = $575M. Goodwill: $1,000M − $575M = $425M.",
    trap: "The follow-up: what changes in an asset deal? The tax basis steps up along with the book values, so there's no new DTL on the write-ups, and goodwill here would be $350M instead of $425M.",
